Title           VMware SVGA Display Driver
Version         OPENSTEP for Mach 4.2, VMWareFB Driver 0.1 (experimental)
Description     Accelerated true-color display driver for QEMU VMware SVGA. Includes the WindowServer display adapter. Install at /, select VMware Display Adapter in Configure, save, shut down cleanly and restart QEMU with -vga vmware. See README.txt for requirements and rollback.
DefaultLocation /
DiskName        VMWareFB
Relocatable     NO
Application     NO
LibrarySubdirectory Standard
InstallOnly     YES
DisableStop     YES
LongFilenames   NO
NeedsAuthorization YES
